{"ID":"20240205153725-6v54aty","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240205153725-6v54aty","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205153725-6v54aty\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205162253-u843v9g\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240614130323-acdix8q\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:867,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240614130712-8zrr4q5\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:8,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:8\u0026#125;","title":"382补25神曲（六神曲）","type":"doc","updated":"20240205162253"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240705135145-facqgcr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240705135145-facqgcr","updated":"20240705135145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 509px;","style":"width: 499px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"神曲"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/神曲-20240705135145-ctkwqb8.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 499px;\" parent-style=\"width: 509px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240205162253-u843v9g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205162253-u843v9g","updated":"20240205162253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"神曲"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/神曲-20240205162253-cxjxhd0.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240614130319-1q3qckw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130319-1q3qckw","updated":"20240705135334"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"注：为"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"辣蓼、青蒿、杏仁泥、赤小豆、鲜苍耳草"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"加入"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"面粉"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"或"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"麸皮"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"后发酵而成的曲剂。"}]},{"ID":"20240614130319-1ygls8d","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614130319-1ygls8d"}},{"ID":"20240614130600-88rp3rd","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614130600-88rp3rd","updated":"20240614130605"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"神曲《冯氏锦囊秘录》"}]},{"ID":"20240614130600-hc7ibas","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130600-hc7ibas","updated":"20240614130600"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"古人所用即造酒之曲，味甘辛气温，性专消导，行脾胃滞气，散脏腑风冷，开胃消宿食消痰，破 结，健脾暖胃，调中下气，此其功也。后人取六神聚会之日，又取各药以象六神，之用，故得神名，陈久更效，其功更胜于酒曲，盖更有消痰利水暖胃下气之药耳。宜炒香方用，孕妇少服。盖即能破结便，能落胎也。及脾阴不足胃火旺者勿用，义与麦芽同也。"}]},{"ID":"20240614130600-j0a8fkz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130600-j0a8fkz","updated":"20240614130600"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"神曲下气调中，止泻开胃，消食消痰，胸腹坚满，赤白痢疾，妇人胎动，产后回乳，有六神者，以脾主中州，一有所伤，则六淫之气，皆可袭之而成病，六神之义意深远矣。"}]},{"ID":"20240614130600-nmx9bas","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130600-nmx9bas","updated":"20240614130600"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主治（痘疹合参） 须陈年者炒黄用。开胃进食，调中下气，消食健脾，凡泻泄，及中焦停满皆可用，惟因痘毒而胀满者忌之。"}]},{"ID":"20240614130600-wka1rhs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130600-wka1rhs","updated":"20240614130600"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"制神曲法，六月六日用白面百斤，以象白虎；苍耳汁三斤，以象勾陈；野蓼汁四斤，以象腾蛇；青蒿汁三斤，以象青龙；杏仁去皮尖，捣烂四斤，及北方河水，以象玄武；赤小豆煮烂三斤，以象朱雀，六味和匀，踏实，再加蘅 汁尤妙，悉如造曲法庵黄，悬风处，经年用之。"}]},{"ID":"20240614130319-tmyetz5","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614130319-tmyetz5"}},{"ID":"20240614130457-wx9kyi3","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614130457-wx9kyi3","updated":"20240614130511"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"神曲《本草经解》"}]},{"ID":"20240614130452-1k9k2ik","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130452-1k9k2ik","updated":"20240614130452"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"气温．味辛甘．无毒．主化水谷宿食．症结积聚．健脾暖胃．（炒黄）"}]},{"ID":"20240614130452-8hqmrcj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130452-8hqmrcj","updated":"20240614130452"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"神曲气温．禀天春升之木气．入足厥阴肝经．味辛甘无毒．得地中西土金之味．入足阳明燥金胃土．气味俱升．阳也．饮食入胃．散精于肝．肝不散精．则水谷宿积矣．积之既久．则有形可征者结于内．神曲气温散肝．肝气疏散．则宿者销而积者化也．肝气既疏畅．则脾土自健．阳者胃脘之阳．辛温益阳．所以又暖胃也．"}]},{"ID":"20240614130452-nfhpzpg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130452-nfhpzpg","updated":"20240614130452"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【制方】"}]},{"ID":"20240614130452-5xxq9vh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130452-5xxq9vh","updated":"20240614130452"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"神曲同茅术丸．健脾燥湿．专炒研末．酒服二钱．能回乳．"}]},{"ID":"20240614130711-xb0ksoc","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614130711-xb0ksoc"}},{"ID":"20240614130712-8zrr4q5","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614130712-8zrr4q5","updated":"20240614130716"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"神曲《本草便读》"}]},{"ID":"20240614130712-j956v6v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130712-j956v6v","updated":"20240614130712"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"配六药以糊成．性味辛甘．温中和胃．合五色而具备．消磨水谷．发表强脾．（神曲用白面为君．再加赤豆杏仁青蒿苍耳野蓼六种．拌和作饼．如窨酱黄法．待发热．外生黄衣．晒干收之．五味兼有．甘辛独多．性温入脾胃．消磨水谷．是其本功．发表者以其有郁蒸之气．性能升发也．谷食去则脾胃和．自可健运如常．消导炒用．发表生用．各随其宜可也．）"}]},{"ID":"20240614130659-oywl3pr","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614130659-oywl3pr"}},{"ID":"20240614130701-k3m4lqx","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614130701-k3m4lqx","updated":"20240614130707"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"神曲《汤液本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240614130701-jmmcfoh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130701-jmmcfoh","updated":"20240614130701"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"气暖，味甘。"}]},{"ID":"20240614130701-z78pz3q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130701-z78pz3q","updated":"20240614130701"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"入足阳明经。"}]},{"ID":"20240614130701-pv9bih9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130701-pv9bih9","updated":"20240614130701"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《象》云∶消食，治脾胃食不化，须于脾胃药中少加之。微炒黄用。"}]},{"ID":"20240614130701-k6h95hr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130701-k6h95hr","updated":"20240614130701"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《珍》云∶益胃气。"}]},{"ID":"20240614130701-vy4fqzq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130701-vy4fqzq","updated":"20240614130701"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《本草》云∶疗脏腑中风气，调中下气，开胃消宿食。主霍乱，心膈气痰逆。除烦，破症结及补虚，去冷气，除肠胃中塞，不下食。令人好颜色。落胎，下鬼胎。又能治小儿腹坚大如盘，胸中满，胎动不安。或腰痛抢心，下血不止。火炒以助天五之气，入足阳明。"}]},{"ID":"20240614130647-qa9j1ea","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614130647-qa9j1ea"}},{"ID":"20240614130648-048bhex","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614130648-048bhex","updated":"20240614130654"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"神曲《长沙药解》"}]},{"ID":"20240614130648-1hcvt3t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130648-1hcvt3t","updated":"20240614130648"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经】无"}]},{"ID":"20240614130648-thuse0w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130648-thuse0w","updated":"20240614130648"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味辛、甘，入足太阴脾经。化谷消痰，泻满除癥。"}]},{"ID":"20240614130648-200d9vm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130648-200d9vm","updated":"20240614130648"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《金匮》"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"薯蓣丸"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"方在薯蓣"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。用之治虚劳百病，以其调中而消滞也。"}]},{"ID":"20240614130648-q17ax39","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130648-q17ax39","updated":"20240614130648"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"神曲辛烈之性，化宿谷停痰，磨硬块坚积，疗胀满泄利，化产后瘀血。"}]},{"ID":"20240614130648-jf7re6w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130648-jf7re6w","updated":"20240614130648"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炒，研用。"}]},{"ID":"20240614130638-c7ilvqc","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614130638-c7ilvqc"}},{"ID":"20240614130639-sze38eq","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614130639-sze38eq","updated":"20240614130643"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"神曲《本草述钩元》"}]},{"ID":"20240614130639-6ti34fk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130639-6ti34fk","updated":"20240614130639"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"造法。于六月六日。用面五斤象白虎。苍耳草自然汁一碗象勾陈。野蓼自然汁一碗象蛇。青蒿自然汁一碗象青龙。杏仁去皮尖五两及北方河水。象元武。赤小豆煮熟去皮四两朱雀。用汁和面豆杏仁作饼。麻叶或楮叶包如造曲法。待生黄衣。取悬风处。经年用。"}]},{"ID":"20240614130639-i2ep796","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130639-i2ep796","updated":"20240614130639"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味甘辛。气温。阳中之阳。入足阳明经。健脾。暖胃。下气。化水谷。消积滞。除痰逆。"}]},{"ID":"20240614130639-jq1udba","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130639-jq1udba","updated":"20240614130639"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"疗暑劳身其痞腹梧子大〔论〕神曲用白面象白虎为君。取人身真气尽统于肺也。用苍耳汁象勾陈。取戊土属胃也。"}]},{"ID":"20240614130639-ez1s3ea","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130639-ez1s3ea","updated":"20240614130639"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"上统而人阳神助凡人脾阴虚。胃火盛者。不宜用。能落胎。孕妇宜少食。（仲淳）〔修治〕凡用须炒黄以助土气。陈久者良。"}]},{"ID":"20240614130628-m4w6y7v","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614130628-m4w6y7v"}},{"ID":"20240614130629-vqvffhr","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614130629-vqvffhr","updated":"20240614130634"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"神曲《本草备要》"}]},{"ID":"20240614130629-zjpc2ws","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130629-zjpc2ws","updated":"20240614130629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"宣，行气，化痰，消食"}]},{"ID":"20240614130629-8edy6s2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130629-8edy6s2","updated":"20240614130629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"辛散气，甘调中，温开胃。化水谷，消积滞（《医余》云∶有伤粽子成积，用曲末少加木香，盐汤下，数日口中闻酒香，积遂散）。治痰逆症结，泻痢胀满。回乳（炒研，酒服二钱，日二）下胎（产后血晕，末服亦良），亦治目病（《启微集》云∶生用，能发其生气；熟用，能敛其暴气）。造曲法，以五月五日，六月六日，用白面百斤，赤豆末、杏仁泥、青蒿、苍耳、红蓼汁各三升，以配青龙、白虎、朱雀、玄武、 蛇、勾陈六神，通和作饼， 生黄衣，晒收。陈者良。炒用。"}]},{"ID":"20240614130617-m1kxgst","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614130617-m1kxgst"}},{"ID":"20240614130618-66cxsfv","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614130618-66cxsfv","updated":"20240614130622"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"神曲《本草求真》"}]},{"ID":"20240614130618-2xkernh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130618-2xkernh","updated":"20240614130618"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（造酿）散气调中温胃化痰逐水消滞"}]},{"ID":"20240614130618-rxezz7v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130618-rxezz7v","updated":"20240614130618"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"神曲（专入脾胃）。辛甘气温。其物本于白面杏仁赤小豆青蒿苍耳红蓼六味作饼蒸郁而成。（造曲法。以五月五日、六月六日、用白面百斤。赤豆未。杏仁泥。青蒿苍耳红蓼汁各三升。以配青龙白虎朱雀玄武腾蛇勾陈六神。通和作饼。 生黄衣。晒收陈久。炒用。）其性六味为一。故能散气调中。温胃化痰。逐水消滞。小儿补脾。轻平等药。医多用此以为调治。（养胃丸治脾胃俱虚。用神曲六两。麦芽三两。炮干姜四两。乌梅肉焙四两。为末水下。又启微集云。神曲治目病。生用能发其生气。熟用能敛其暴气也。）盖取辛不甚散。甘不甚壅。温不见燥也。然必合以补脾等药并施则佳。若孕妇无积。及脾阴不足胃火旺者。并勿用耳。义与麦芽同也。"}]},{"ID":"20240614130319-djw59lv","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614130319-djw59lv"}},{"ID":"20240614130441-kcglsmk","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614130441-kcglsmk","updated":"20240614130445"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"神曲《本草从新》"}]},{"ID":"20240614130441-e8nals9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130441-e8nals9","updated":"20240614130441"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"宣、行气化痰、消食．"}]},{"ID":"20240614130441-32tvret","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130441-32tvret","updated":"20240614130441"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"辛散气．甘调中．温开胃．化水谷．消积滞．（医余云∶有伤粽子成积、用曲末、少加木香、盐汤下、数日鼻中闻酒香、积遂散而愈．）治痰逆症结．腹痛泻痢．胀满翻胃．回乳（炒研、酒服二钱、日二．）下胎．（产后血晕、末服亦良．）亦治目病．（倪惟德原机启微集云∶生用能发其生气、熟用能敛其暴气．）脾阴虚．胃火盛者勿用．能损胎．造曲法、以五月五日或六月六日．以白面百斤．青蒿、苍耳、野蓼．各取自然汁三升．杏仁泥、赤小豆末．各三升．以配白虎、青龙、朱雀、玄武、勾陈、 蛇、六神．通和作饼．麻叶或楮叶包罨．如造酱黄法．待生黄衣．晒干收之．陈久者良．研细炒黄．酒药曲、近今各地．有入诸药草及毒腑，断不可服．（食积心痛、陈神曲一块、烧红、淬酒二大碗服之．）"}]},{"ID":"20240614130319-d0o949t","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614130319-d0o949t"}},{"ID":"20240614130430-sp2c1km","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614130430-sp2c1km","updated":"20240614130435"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"神曲《本经逢原》"}]},{"ID":"20240614130430-m2e3pb3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130430-m2e3pb3","updated":"20240614130430"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"酒曲，红曲，女曲"}]},{"ID":"20240614130430-0j5y81e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130430-0j5y81e","updated":"20240614130430"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"甘微苦辛平，无毒。造神曲法，夏日用白面五斤，入青蒿、苍耳、野蓼自然汁各一碗，杏仁泥四两，赤小豆二两，煮研拌面作曲，风干，陈久者良，炒香用。举世以相思子作小豆，大谬。"}]},{"ID":"20240614130430-wu1yfu9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130430-wu1yfu9","updated":"20240614130430"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"发明"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"神曲入阳明胃经，其功专于消化谷麦酒积。陈久者良。但有积者，能消化，无积而久服则消人元气。故脾阴虚胃火盛当禁也。酒曲亦能消食去滞气，行药力，但力峻伤胃。"}]},{"ID":"20240614130430-435euqj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130430-435euqj","updated":"20240614130430"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"红曲乃粳米所造，然必福建制者为良。活血消食，有治脾胃营血之功。女人经血阻滞，赤痢下重，宜加用之。女曲是女人以完麦罨成黄子，消食下气，止泻痢，破冷血，《千金方》恒用之。"}]},{"ID":"20240614130319-zox6fyw","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614130319-zox6fyw"}},{"ID":"20240614130420-f5sei4m","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614130420-f5sei4m","updated":"20240614130424"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"神曲《医学入门》"}]},{"ID":"20240614130420-sl0xfei","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130420-sl0xfei","updated":"20240614130420"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"神曲甘温破坚癖，消心膈痰进饮食，调中止泄止霍乱，更医痢痔及劳复。"}]},{"ID":"20240614130420-sobcy35","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130420-sobcy35","updated":"20240614130420"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"神，按六神而造；曲，朽也，郁之使生衣朽败也。无毒。纯阳。入足阳明经。破 结、水腹坚大如盘，消心膈气，痰逆胸满，肠胃中塞，饮食不下，宜此开胃健脾，消化水谷。止霍乱泄泻，痢下赤白。消食痔，疗伤寒饮食劳复；兼治脏腑中风气，补虚去冷气；落胎，下鬼胎，治卒胎动不安，或腰痛胎转抢心，下血不止，小儿痫疾。又六畜食米胀欲死者，煮汁灌之立消。麸皮曲，性凉，入大肠，亦消食积。红曲，活血消食。造神曲法∶六月六日，或三伏上寅日，采蓼草三两，青蒿、苍耳草各六两，俱捣自然汁，杏仁末一两、带麸白面二升，赤小豆一碗，煮软熟，去皮研，然后取前汁共一处拌匀，踏实成曲。一如造酒药法出白，愈久愈好，入药炒令香。"}]},{"ID":"20240614130319-yjwsf2t","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614130319-yjwsf2t"}},{"ID":"20240614130407-euuup01","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614130407-euuup01","updated":"20240614130413"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"神曲《本草易读》"}]},{"ID":"20240614130407-agb03p8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130407-agb03p8","updated":"20240614130407"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"炒用。陈久者良。"}]},{"ID":"20240614130407-afozyud","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130407-afozyud","updated":"20240614130407"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味甘，辛，温，无毒。行气化痰，开胃消食，回乳落胎，除结破核。疗泻痢而退胀满，定霍乱而止闪腰。"}]},{"ID":"20240614130407-7yszsvg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130407-7yszsvg","updated":"20240614130407"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"造神曲法，五月五日或六月六日，用白面若干，青蒿汁、赤小豆末、杏仁泥、苍耳汁、野蓼汁，以配白虎等六神，以诸汁合面，豆、杏作饼，楮叶包 ，待生黄衣，晒收之。"}]},{"ID":"20240614130319-kxwznq3","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614130319-kxwznq3"}},{"ID":"20240614130334-v04i510","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614130334-v04i510","updated":"20240614130401"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"神曲《神农本草经读》"}]},{"ID":"20240614130334-wcv2you","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130334-wcv2you","updated":"20240614130334"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"气味辛、甘、温，无毒。主化水谷宿食，症结积聚，健脾暖胃。（《药性》）陈修园曰∶凡曲皆主化谷，谷积服此便消。或鼻中如闻酒香，药性所言主治，亦不外此。"}]},{"ID":"20240614130334-rr7pmtq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130334-rr7pmtq","updated":"20240614130334"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"症结积聚者，水谷之积久而成也。健脾暖胃者，化水谷之效也。除化水谷之外，并无他长。"}]},{"ID":"20240614130334-eo9yr9s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130334-eo9yr9s","updated":"20240614130334"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"今人以之常服，且云祛百病，怪甚！考造曲之法；六月六日，是六神聚会之曰，用白曲百斤，青蒿、苍耳、野蓼各自然汁三斤，杏仁研泥、赤小豆为末各三升，以配青龙、白虎、朱雀、元武、勾陈、蛇六神，通和作饼，麻叶或楮叶包，如造酱黄法，待生黄衣，晒干收之。陈久者良。药用六种，以配六神聚会之日，发黄衣作曲，故名六神曲。今人除去“六”字，只名神曲，任意加至数十味，无非克破之药，大伤元气，且有百草神曲，害人更甚！近日通行福建神曲，其方于六神本方中，去赤小豆，恶其易蛀，加五苓散料、平胃散料及麦芽，谷芽、使君子、榧子、大黄、黄芩、大腹皮、砂仁、白蔻、丁香、木香、藿香、香附、良姜、芍药、防风、秦艽、羌活、独活、川芎、苏叶、荆芥、防己、党参、茯苓、莱菔子、苡米、木通、茶叶、干姜、干葛、枳壳、山楂、槟榔、青皮、木瓜、薄荷、蝉蜕、桃仁、红花、三棱、莪术、郁金、葛蒲、柴胡、菊花等为末，制为方块，以草发黄衣晒干。此方杂乱无序，误人匪浅，而竟盛行一时者，皆误信招牌上夸张等语。而惯以肥甘自奉之辈，单服此克化之品，未尝不通快一时，而损伤元气，人自不觉。若以入方，则古人之方，立法不苟，岂堪此杂乱之药，碍此碍彼乎？且以药末合五谷，造发黄而为曲，只取其速于酿化，除消导之外，并无他长，何以统治百病？且表散之品，因发而失其辛香之气；攻坚之品，以发而失其雄入之权。补养之药，气味中和，以发而变为臭腐秽浊之物，伤脾妨胃，更不待言。明者自知。余临证二十年，而泉州一带，先救误服神曲之害者，十居其七。如感冒病，宜审经以发散，若服神曲，则里气以攻伐而虚，表邪随虚而入里矣。伤食新病，宜助胃以克化；伤食颇久，宜承气以攻下。若服神曲，则酿成甜酸秽腐之味，滞于中焦，漫无出路，则为恶心胀痛矣。吐泻是阴阳之不交，泄泻是水谷不分，赤白痢是湿热下注，噎隔是贲门干槁，翻胃是命门火衰，痰饮是水气泛溢，与神曲更无干涉；若误服之，轻则致重，重则致死，可不慎哉！（唯“范志”字号药品精，制法妙，余与吴先生名条光同年，因知其详。可恨市中多假其字号，宜细辨之。）"}]},{"ID":"20240614130319-n0pajnt","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614130319-n0pajnt"}},{"ID":"20240614130320-y53c4ak","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614130320-y53c4ak","updated":"20240614130320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中药大辞典》：神曲"}]},{"ID":"20240614130320-j1po3dm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130320-j1po3dm","updated":"20240614130320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240614130320-bymt7vw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130320-bymt7vw","updated":"20240614130320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Shén Qū"}]},{"ID":"20240614130320-ol9kt15","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130320-ol9kt15","updated":"20240614130320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240614130320-a662x12","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130320-a662x12","updated":"20240614130320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 六神曲（《本草便读》）。"}]},{"ID":"20240614130320-75p32y3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130320-75p32y3","updated":"20240614130320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出处"}]},{"ID":"20240614130320-pzfxpjs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130320-pzfxpjs","updated":"20240614130320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《药性论》"}]},{"ID":"20240614130320-bjx7y6g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130320-bjx7y6g","updated":"20240614130320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240614130320-j191k01","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130320-j191k01","updated":"20240614130320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 为辣蓼、青蒿、杏仁等药加入面粉或麸皮混和后，经发酵而成的曲剂。"}]},{"ID":"20240614130320-o6jqcpr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130320-o6jqcpr","updated":"20240614130320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状"}]},{"ID":"20240614130320-3s48po2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130320-3s48po2","updated":"20240614130320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 呈方形或长方形的块状，宽约3厘米，厚约1厘米，外表土黄色，粗糙；质硬脆易断，断面不平，类白色，可见未被粉碎的褐色残渣及发酵后的空洞。有陈腐气，味苦。以陈久、无虫蛀者佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240614130320-pzzgryl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130320-pzzgryl","updated":"20240614130320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"化学成分"}]},{"ID":"20240614130320-yntqw13","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130320-yntqw13","updated":"20240614130320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 神曲中有酵母菌。其成分有挥发油，甙类、脂肪油及维生素B等。"}]},{"ID":"20240614130320-zfhynb2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130320-zfhynb2","updated":"20240614130320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炮制"}]},{"ID":"20240614130320-2mmghir","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130320-2mmghir","updated":"20240614130320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 炒神曲：取麸皮撒匀于热锅内，俟起烟，将神曲倒入，炒至黄色，取出，筛去麸皮，放凉；或不加麸皮，炒至黄色亦可。焦神曲：取神曲置锅内炒至外表呈焦黑色，内部焦黄色，取出，略喷些清水，放凉。"}]},{"ID":"20240614130320-gtsemzh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130320-gtsemzh","updated":"20240614130320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归经"}]},{"ID":"20240614130320-0zj2p1g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130320-0zj2p1g","updated":"20240614130320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 入脾、胃经。"}]},{"ID":"20240614130320-tbrbejr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130320-tbrbejr","updated":"20240614130320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《汤液本草》：\"入足阳明经。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614130320-etvvzoi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130320-etvvzoi","updated":"20240614130320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《雷公炮制药性解》：\"入脾、胃二经。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614130320-4eghj5o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130320-4eghj5o","updated":"20240614130320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《本草经解》：\"入足厥阴肝经，足阳明胃经。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614130320-x6a70od","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130320-x6a70od","updated":"20240614130320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240614130320-7w76zy2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130320-7w76zy2","updated":"20240614130320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 甘辛，温。"}]},{"ID":"20240614130320-t5prtyf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130320-t5prtyf","updated":"20240614130320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《珍珠囊》：\"辛。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614130320-d0j67r2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130320-d0j67r2","updated":"20240614130320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《汤液本草》：\"气暖，味甘。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614130320-4ga749p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130320-4ga749p","updated":"20240614130320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《滇南本草》：\"性平，味甘。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614130320-m0q76h6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130320-m0q76h6","updated":"20240614130320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④《纲目》：\"甘辛，温，无毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614130320-7somrgk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130320-7somrgk","updated":"20240614130320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意"}]},{"ID":"20240614130320-9kbu2e5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130320-9kbu2e5","updated":"20240614130320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《本草经疏》：\"脾阴虚，胃火盛者不宜用；能落胎，孕妇宜少食。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614130320-2rt2ogm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130320-2rt2ogm","updated":"20240614130320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240614130320-ztj1k39","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130320-ztj1k39","updated":"20240614130320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 健脾和胃，消食调中。治饮食停滞，胸痞腹胀，呕吐泻痢，产后瘀血腹痛，小儿腹大坚积。"}]},{"ID":"20240614130320-8598f8v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130320-8598f8v","updated":"20240614130320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《药性论》：\"化水谷宿食，症结积滞，健脾暖胃。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614130320-s7w9yk9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130320-s7w9yk9","updated":"20240614130320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②张元素：\"养胃气。治亦白荆。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614130320-20i1zzc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130320-20i1zzc","updated":"20240614130320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《汤液本草》：\"疗脏腑中风气，调中下气，开胃消宿食。主霍乱心膈气，痰逆，除烦，破症结及补虚，去冷气，除肠胃中塞，不下食。能治小儿腹坚大如盘，胸中满，胎动不安，或腰痛抢心，下血不止。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614130320-6knqahe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130320-6knqahe","updated":"20240614130320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④《纲目》：\"消食下气，除痰逆霍乱泄痢胀满。闪挫腰痛者，煅过淬酒温服有效，妇人产后欲回乳者，炒研酒服二钱，日二。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614130320-290bjf9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130320-290bjf9","updated":"20240614130320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤《本草述》：\"治伤暑，伤饮食，伤劳倦，疟气痞证，水肿胀满积聚，痰饮咳嗽，呕吐反胃，霍乱，蓄血，心痛，胃脘痛，胁痛，痹痿眩晕，身重，不能食，黄疸。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614130320-3p3tec7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130320-3p3tec7","updated":"20240614130320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑥《本草再新》：\"消瘰疬疽瘤。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614130320-pwfcqyc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130320-pwfcqyc","updated":"20240614130320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240614130320-w4jp7v0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130320-w4jp7v0","updated":"20240614130320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 内服：煎汤，2～4钱；或研末入丸、散。"}]},{"ID":"20240614130320-8tfd3nu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130320-8tfd3nu","updated":"20240614130320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"复方"}]},{"ID":"20240614130320-ct5avb6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130320-ct5avb6","updated":"20240614130320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①治脾胃俱虚，不能消化水谷，胸膈痞闷，腹胁时胀，连年累月，食减嗜卧，口苦无味，虚羸少气：乌梅（去核焙干）、干姜（炮）各四两，小麦蘖（炒黄）三两，神曲（捣末炒）六两二钱。上件为末，炼蜜和搜为丸如梧桐子大，每服十五丸加至二十丸，米饮下，日二服，不计时候。（《局方》消食丸）"}]},{"ID":"20240614130320-d51w79m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130320-d51w79m","updated":"20240614130320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②治脾虚不能磨食：神曲四两，白爪三两，人参一两（俱炒），枳实（麸拌炒）五钱，砂仁（炒）四钱。共为末。饴糖为丸，梧子大。每早晚各服三钱，白汤下。（《方脉正宗》）"}]},{"ID":"20240614130320-pia4dd7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130320-pia4dd7","updated":"20240614130320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③治时暑暴泻及饮食所伤，胸膈痞闷：神曲（炒）、苍术（米泔浸一宿焙干）各等分。为末，面糊为丸，如梧桐子大。每服三十丸，不拘时，米饮吞下。（《局方》曲术丸）"}]},{"ID":"20240614130320-xjn9sfc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130320-xjn9sfc","updated":"20240614130320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④治暴泻：神曲（微炒），吴茱萸（绿色者拣净，泡洗七遍）各一两。上二味为细末，以酸米醋为丸如梧桐子大。每服五十丸至一百丸，空心食前米饮汤下。（《百一选方》孙盈仲·断下丸）"}]},{"ID":"20240614130320-42ucxcs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130320-42ucxcs","updated":"20240614130320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤治休息痢，日夜不止，腹内冷痛：神曲、芜荑、吴茱萸各等分。熬，生姜自然汁和丸，如梧桐子大。食前粥饮下三十丸，（《普济方》神曲丸）"}]},{"ID":"20240614130320-8ujzxc7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130320-8ujzxc7","updated":"20240614130320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑥治产后冷痢，脐下疞痛：神曲三两（微妙令黄），熟干地黄二两，白术一两半。上件药捣细罗为散。每服，以粥饮调下二钱，日三、四服。（《圣惠方》神曲散）"}]},{"ID":"20240614130320-8twi99o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130320-8twi99o","updated":"20240614130320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑦治食积心痛：陈神曲一块。烧红，淬酒二大碗服之。（《摘元方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240614130320-dw8sgh3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130320-dw8sgh3","updated":"20240614130320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑧治产乳运绝，亦治产难：神曲末，水服方寸匕。（《千金方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240614130320-03k51zz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130320-03k51zz","updated":"20240614130320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑨治产后瘀血不运，肚腹胀闷，渐成臌胀：陈久神曲一斤。捣碎，微炒磨为末。每早晚各服三钱，食前砂仁汤调服。亦可治小儿食臌胀。（《本草汇言》）"}]},{"ID":"20240614130320-c05v3tm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130320-c05v3tm","updated":"20240614130320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"各家论述"}]},{"ID":"20240614130320-en61gso","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130320-en61gso","updated":"20240614130320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①《纲目》：\"按倪维德（启微集》云：神曲治目病，生用能发其生气，热用能敛其暴气也。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614130320-ahnv9ot","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130320-ahnv9ot","updated":"20240614130320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《本草经疏》：\"古人用曲，即造酒之曲，其气味甘温，性专消导，行脾胃滞气，散脏腑风冷。神曲乃后人专造，以供药用，力倍于酒曲。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614130320-bv5opxy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130320-bv5opxy","updated":"20240614130320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《本草正》：\"神曲，味甘气平，炒黄入药，善助中焦土脏，健脾暖胃，消食下气，化滞调中，逐痰积，破症瘕，运化水谷，除霍乱胀满呕吐。其气腐，故能除湿热，其性涩，故又止泻痢。疗女人胎动因滞，治小儿腹坚因积。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614130320-dn6uych","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130320-dn6uych","updated":"20240614130320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④《药品化义》：\"神曲，味甘，炒香，香能醒脾，甘能洽胃，以此平胃气，理中焦，用治脾虚难运，霍乱吐逆，寒湿泄泻，妇人胎动抢心，下血不止。若生用力胜，主消米谷食积，痰滞癥结，胸满疟痞，小儿腹坚，皆能奏绩。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614130320-b901mtz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130320-b901mtz","updated":"20240614130320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤《本经逢原》：\"神曲，其功专于消化谷麦酒积，陈久者良。但有积者能消化，无积而久服，则消人元气。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614130320-71imxx7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130320-71imxx7","updated":"20240614130320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑥《本草求真》：\"神曲，辛甘气温，其物本于白面、杏仁、赤小豆、青蒿、苍耳、红蓼六味，作饼蒸郁而成，其性六味为一，故能散气调中，温胃化痰，逐水消滞，小儿补脾，医多用此以为调治，盖取辛不甚散，甘不甚壅，温不见燥也。然必合以补脾等药，并施则佳。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614130320-essmtml","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130320-essmtml","updated":"20240614130320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑦《国药的药理学》：\"神曲，是借其发酵作用以促进消化机能，但是在胃酸过多、发酵异常的患者，当绝对避免使用。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614130320-6gu30f2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130320-6gu30f2","updated":"20240614130320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"制法"}]},{"ID":"20240614130320-1z1ulyu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130320-1z1ulyu","updated":"20240614130320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 用鲜青蒿、鲜苍耳、鲜辣蓼各12斤，切碎；赤小豆碾末、杏仁去皮研各6斤，混合拌匀，入麦麸100斤，白面60斤，加水适量，揉成团块，压平后用稻草或麻袋覆盖，使之发酵，至外表长出黄色菌丝时取出，切成约3厘米见方的小块，晒干即成。"}]},{"ID":"20240614130320-vmef9c8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130320-vmef9c8","updated":"20240614130320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"另法：用鲜蓼子4.5斤，鲜青蒿、鲜苍耳各1.5斤，洗净切碎，加水浸泡；杏仁去皮研碎，6斤；赤小豆研碎，6斤，加水煮成粥状，混合拌和，入白面150斤，略加清水，反复揉匀，然后压成方块，用麻叶包裹，置温室中经发酵后，切成小块，晒干即成。"}]},{"ID":"20240614130320-7tnzwq2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130320-7tnzwq2","updated":"20240614130320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240614130320-fje9uut","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130320-fje9uut","updated":"20240614130320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中药大辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240614130320-rgn9mec","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614130320-rgn9mec","updated":"20240614130320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中华本草》：神曲"}]},{"ID":"20240614130320-wet0y0s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130320-wet0y0s","updated":"20240614130320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240614130320-soulj2g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130320-soulj2g","updated":"20240614130320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Shén Qū"}]},{"ID":"20240614130320-wzthb0m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130320-wzthb0m","updated":"20240614130320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240614130320-boco9oa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130320-boco9oa","updated":"20240614130320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 六神曲、六曲"}]},{"ID":"20240614130320-fyk9j30","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130320-fyk9j30","updated":"20240614130320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"英文名"}]},{"ID":"20240614130320-lbfk499","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130320-lbfk499","updated":"20240614130320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Medicated Leaven"}]},{"ID":"20240614130320-dcg30m7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130320-dcg30m7","updated":"20240614130320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出处"}]},{"ID":"20240614130320-r0ylf04","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130320-r0ylf04","updated":"20240614130320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 出自《药性论》"}]},{"ID":"20240614130320-f8y662w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130320-f8y662w","updated":"20240614130320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240614130320-tt239s7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130320-tt239s7","updated":"20240614130320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 药材基源：为辣蓼、青蒿、杏仁等药加入面粉或麸皮混和后，经发酵而成的曲剂。"}]},{"ID":"20240614130320-hb3c2v6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130320-hb3c2v6","updated":"20240614130320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拉丁植物动物矿物名：Massa Medicata Fermentata"}]},{"ID":"20240614130320-czqijmm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130320-czqijmm","updated":"20240614130320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状"}]},{"ID":"20240614130320-gol2w4y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130320-gol2w4y","updated":"20240614130320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 性状鉴别 本品呈方形或长方形的块状，宽约3cm，厚约1cm，外表土黄色，粗糙；质硬脆，易断，断面不平整，类白色，可见未被粉碎的褐色残渣及发酵后的空洞。有陈腐气，味苦。以身干、陈久、无虫蛀、杂质少者为佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240614130320-xhlddtk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130320-xhlddtk","updated":"20240614130320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"化学成分"}]},{"ID":"20240614130320-cb03009","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130320-cb03009","updated":"20240614130320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 神曲为酵母制剂，含酵母菌，淀粉酶，维生素B复合体，麦角甾醇（ergosterol），蛋白质及脂肪，挥发油等。"}]},{"ID":"20240614130320-6zkl706","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130320-6zkl706","updated":"20240614130320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"药理作用"}]},{"ID":"20240614130320-s1lmw1a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130320-s1lmw1a","updated":"20240614130320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 含多量酵母菌和B族维生素。干酵母菌中也含多种B族维生素，故本品具有B族维生素样作用，如增进食欲，维持正常消化机能等。"}]},{"ID":"20240614130320-2d5n0xz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130320-2d5n0xz","updated":"20240614130320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炮制"}]},{"ID":"20240614130320-7tktqu0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130320-7tktqu0","updated":"20240614130320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 炒神曲：取麸皮撒匀于热锅内，俟起烟，将神曲倒入，炒至黄色，取出，筛去麸皮，放凉；或不加麸皮，炒至黄色亦可。焦神曲：取神曲置锅内炒至外表呈焦黑色， 内部焦黄色，取出，略喷些清水，放凉。"}]},{"ID":"20240614130320-kfmqch5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130320-kfmqch5","updated":"20240614130320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归经"}]},{"ID":"20240614130320-jj91imi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130320-jj91imi","updated":"20240614130320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 脾；胃经"}]},{"ID":"20240614130320-ql2s0ke","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130320-ql2s0ke","updated":"20240614130320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240614130320-kw1obhk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130320-kw1obhk","updated":"20240614130320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 甘；辛；温；无毒"}]},{"ID":"20240614130320-tprc60h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130320-tprc60h","updated":"20240614130320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意"}]},{"ID":"20240614130320-qe4ng3u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130320-qe4ng3u","updated":"20240614130320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 脾阴不足，胃火盛，及孕妇慎服。"}]},{"ID":"20240614130320-mizve3u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130320-mizve3u","updated":"20240614130320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240614130320-a2z59us","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130320-a2z59us","updated":"20240614130320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 健脾和胃；消食化积。主饮食停滞；消化不良；脘腹胀满；食欲不振；呕吐泻痢"}]},{"ID":"20240614130320-300hc35","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130320-300hc35","updated":"20240614130320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240614130320-q55wkeu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130320-q55wkeu","updated":"20240614130320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 内服:煎汤，10-15g；或入丸、散。"}]},{"ID":"20240614130320-9gulqqs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130320-9gulqqs","updated":"20240614130320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"复方"}]},{"ID":"20240614130320-6396f8p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130320-6396f8p","updated":"20240614130320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①治脾胃俱虚，不能消化水谷，胸膈痞闷，腹胁时胀，连年累月，食减嗜卧，口苦无味，虚羸少气：乌梅(去核焙干)、干姜(炮＞各四两，小麦蘖(炒黄)三两，神曲(捣末炒)六两二钱。上件为末；炼蜜和搜为丸如梧桐子大，每服十五丸加至二十丸，米饮下，日二服，不计时候。(《局方》消食丸)②治脾虚不能磨食:神曲四两，白术三两，人参一两(俱炒)，枳实(麸拌炒)五钱，砂仁(炒)四钱。共为末。饴糖为丸，梧子大。每早晚各服三钱，白汤下。(《方脉正宗》)③治时暑暴泻及饮食所伤，胸膈痞闷： 神曲(炒)、苍术(米泔浸一宿焙干)各等分。为末，面做为丸，如梧桐子大。每服三十丸，不拘时，米饮吞下。(《局方》曲术丸)④治暴泻：神曲(微炒)，吴茱萸(绿色者拣净，泡洗七遍)各一两。上二味为细床，以酸米醋为丸如梧桐子大。每服五十丸至十百丸，空心食前米饮汤下。(《百一选方》孙盈仲·断下丸)⑤治休息痢，日夜不止，腹内冷痛：神曲、芜荑、吴茱萸各等分。熬，生姜自然汁和丸，如梧桐子大。食前粥饮下三十丸。(《普济方》神曲丸)⑥治产质冷痢，脐下XIU痛：神曲三两(微炒令黄)，熟干地黄二两，白术一两半。上件药捣细罗为散。每服，以粥饮调下二钱，日三、四服。(《圣惠方》神曲散)⑦治食积心痛：陈神曲一块。烧红，淬酒二大碗服之。(《摘元方》)⑧治产乳运绝，亦治产难：神曲末，水服方寸匕。(《千金方》)⑨治产后瘀血不适，肚腹胀闷，渐成臌胀：陈久神曲一斤。捣碎，微炒磨为末。每早晚各服三钱，食前砂仁汤调服。亦可治小儿食膨胀。(《本草汇言》)"}]},{"ID":"20240614130320-soybwyx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130320-soybwyx","updated":"20240614130320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"各家论述"}]},{"ID":"20240614130320-hpgi0wc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130320-hpgi0wc","updated":"20240614130320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.《纲目》：按倪维德《启微集》云：神曲治目病，生用能发其生气，熟用能敛其暴气也。"}]},{"ID":"20240614130320-m85t8az","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130320-m85t8az","updated":"20240614130320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《本草经疏》：古人用曲，即造酒之曲，其气味甘温，性专消导，行脾胃滞气，散脏腑风冷。神曲乃后人专造，以供药用，加倍于酒曲。"}]},{"ID":"20240614130320-agjp38d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130320-agjp38d","updated":"20240614130320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.《本草正》：神曲，味甘气平，炒黄入药，善助中焦土脏，健脾暖胃，消食下气，化滞调中，逐痰积，破症瘕，运化水谷，除霍乱胀满呕吐。其气腐，故能除湿热，其性涩，故又止泻痢。疗女人胎动因滞，治小儿腹坚因积。"}]},{"ID":"20240614130320-q09a2sd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130320-q09a2sd","updated":"20240614130320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.《药品化义》：神曲，味甘，炒香，香能醒脾，甘能洽胃，以此平胃气，理中焦，用治脾虚难运，霍乱吐逆，寒湿泄泻，妇人胎动抢心，下血不止。若生用力胜，主消米谷食积，痰滞症结，胸满疟痞，小儿腹坚，皆能奏绩。"}]},{"ID":"20240614130320-cg44nvg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130320-cg44nvg","updated":"20240614130320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5.《本经逢原》：神曲，其功专于消化谷麦酒积，陈久者良。但有积者能消化，无积而久服，则消人元气。"}]},{"ID":"20240614130320-z0113ke","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130320-z0113ke","updated":"20240614130320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6.《本草求真》：神曲，辛甘气温，其物本于白面、杏仁、赤小豆、青蒿、苍耳、红蓼六味，作饼蒸郁而成，其性六味为一，故能散气调中，温胃化痰，逐水消滞，小儿补脾，医多用此以为调治，盖取辛不甚散，甘不甚壅，温不见燥也。然必合以补脾等药，并施则佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240614130320-f5gbenp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130320-f5gbenp","updated":"20240614130320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7.《国药的药理学》：神曲，是借其发酵作用以促进消化机能，但是在胃酸过多、发酵异常的患者，当绝对避免使用。"}]},{"ID":"20240614130320-olgow6r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130320-olgow6r","updated":"20240614130320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"8.《药性论》：化水谷宿食，症结积滞，健脾暖胃。"}]},{"ID":"20240614130320-qt6qrs5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130320-qt6qrs5","updated":"20240614130320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"9.张元素：养胃气。治赤白痢。"}]},{"ID":"20240614130320-6s8pxjo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130320-6s8pxjo","updated":"20240614130320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"10.《汤液本草》：疗脏腑中风气，调中下气，开胃消宿食。主霍乱心膈气，痰逆，除烦，破症结及补虚，去冷气，除肠胃中塞，不下食。能治小儿腹坚大如盘，胸中满，胎动不安，或腰痛抢心，下血不止。"}]},{"ID":"20240614130320-tpwxrtt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130320-tpwxrtt","updated":"20240614130320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"11.《纲目》：消食下气，除痰逆霍乱泄痢胀满。闪挫腰痛者，煅过淬酒温服有效，妇人产后欲回乳者，炒研酒服二钱，日二。"}]},{"ID":"20240614130320-hk9osyk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130320-hk9osyk","updated":"20240614130320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"12.《本草述》：治伤暑，伤饮食，伤劳倦，疟气痞证，水肿胀满积聚，痰饮咳嗽，呕吐反胃，霍乱，蓄血，心痛，胃脘痛，胁痛，痹痿眩晕、身重，不能食，黄疸。"}]},{"ID":"20240614130320-7i5gzw5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130320-7i5gzw5","updated":"20240614130320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"13.《本草再新》：消瘰疬疽瘤。"}]},{"ID":"20240614130320-t96ykk9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130320-t96ykk9","updated":"20240614130320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240614130320-4c3980f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130320-4c3980f","updated":"20240614130320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240614130322-i3x8uhq","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614130322-i3x8uhq"}},{"ID":"20240614130323-acdix8q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130323-acdix8q"}}]}